{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206250","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120625001:1":{"text":"거기 두 분, 와서 좀 쉬세요.","source_cn":"嘿，两位，快来好好休息一会儿吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C17AA2A65DD340D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120625002:1":{"text":"그나저나 무슨 얘기를 나눈 겁니까?","source_cn":"你们刚才说什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4791E34FCD1C9EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1120625002":{"text":"그나저나 무슨 얘기를 나눈 겁니까?","source_cn":"你们刚才说什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4791E34FCD1C9EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120625003:1":{"text":"중요한 일이라… 여러분 트레져 헌터죠? 그렇다면…","source_cn":"重要的事……你们几个，是宝藏猎人吧？那说的难道是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7CB24728E8D372C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120625004:1":{"text":"맞아요. 행선지와 보물이 숨겨진 곳을 다시 체크해 봤습니다.","source_cn":"是的，除了确定行进方向，我们还重新评估了藏宝点的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B2D7D1CA6CE0387","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s