，前行！向着宝藏，向着友谊，也向着希望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE785455349A737B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1120625010":{"text":"보물, 우정, 그리고 희망을 향하여 전진!!","source_cn":"前行，前行！向着宝藏，向着友谊，也向着希望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE785455349A737B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120625011:0":{"text":"네! 맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"好的！包在我们身上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E95E84E19E7E73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120625012:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 저희도 알아요!","source_cn":"放心吧，我们都明白！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FB28896864F0D22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120625013:1":{"text":"보물이라… 가는 길에 볼 수 있으면 참 좋을 텐데…","source_cn":"宝藏啊……要是能顺路见识一下不就巧了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAE45317F87CA6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1120625013":{"text":"보물이라… 가는 길에 볼 수 있으면 참 좋을 텐데…","source_cn":"宝藏啊……要是能顺路见识一下不就巧了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAE45317F87CA6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":